  "steps": [
    "Cauliflower: mix the flour and spices, then add the water gradually until you get a thick batter.",
    "Coat the florets in the batter, then in the panko, and spread on a baking tray.",
    "Bake at 200 °C for 20–30 minutes, turning halfway. A little olive oil helps them brown.",
    "Sauce: mix everything, brush over the baked florets and return to the oven for 10–15 minutes, without letting it burn.",
    "Mayo: char the aubergines directly over a gas flame, turning, until the skin is black and the flesh soft. Cool, peel and blend the flesh with the other ingredients, adding the water gradually until creamy.",
    "Serve the cauliflower with the mayo."
  ]
